{"id":20971,"name":"Pasco County","slug":"pasco-county","state":"Florida","code":"FL","program":null,"sourceUrl":"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/hybrid/hybrid-tax-sales-states/florida-tax-lien-deeds-18-potential-return/pasco-county/","lastUpdated":"2025-05-26T01:54:35","facts":{"taxSaleType":"Tax Lien Certificates and Tax Deeds","redemptionPeriod":"Two years","interestRate":"Bids start at 18%; minimum earned is 5% unless bid at 0%","extra":[{"label":"Delinquency Date","value":"April 1"},{"label":"Tax Certificate Sale","value":"By June 1, online through LienHub"},{"label":"Tax Deed Application","value":"After two years of delinquency"},{"label":"Tax Deed Sale","value":"Online via RealAuction"},{"label":"Bid Deposit","value":"5% of the anticipated high bid or $200 minimum"},{"label":"Payment Deadline","value":"Full payment due by 10:00 AM ET next business day"},{"label":"Payment Methods","value":"Wire transfer, cash, cashier’s check (no personal checks)"},{"label":"Unsold Properties","value":"Available after 91 days"},{"label":"Research Needed","value":"Title searches highly recommended"},{"label":"Official Resources","value":"Clerk & Comptroller and Pasco County Tax Collector"}]},"bodyHtml":"\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed aligncenter is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://youtu.be/YDEiiZotzO0?si=2uOFC1Z8vyCr3u9T\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://success.taxlienschool.com/abcs-free-2?el=tls-vault-county-blog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Get Dustin Hahn’s Tax Lien and Deed FREE Mini-Course</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:28px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-pasco-county-florida-tax-deed-sales-a-complete-guide\">Pasco County, Florida Tax Deed Sales: A Complete Guide</h1>\n\n\n\n<p>If you&#8217;re looking to invest in Pasco County&#8217;s tax sales, knowing the key steps and rules is super important. Here&#8217;s everything you need to know in plain, simple language.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-how-pasco-county-handles-tax-sales\">How Pasco County Handles Tax Sales</h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Delinquency Date</strong><br>Property taxes become delinquent every year on <strong>April 1</strong>.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Tax Certificate Sale</strong><br>Held <strong>on or before June 1</strong> through an online auction. Investors can buy tax certificates, which are liens on properties with unpaid taxes.<br>Learn more on the <a href=\"https://www.pascotaxes.com/taxes/tax-information/delinquent-real-estate-taxes/tax-sale-information/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Pasco County Tax Collector website</mark></a>.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Redemption Period</strong><br>Property owners have <strong>two years</strong> (starting April 1 of the certificate year) to pay the back taxes, interest, and fees.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Tax Deed Application</strong><br>If the property isn’t redeemed in two years, the investor can apply for a tax deed to start the foreclosure process.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Tax Deed Sale</strong><br>Sales are held <strong>online</strong>, usually <strong>Thursdays at 10:00 AM ET</strong>, through <a href=\"https://pasco.realtaxdeed.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"></a><a href=\"https://pasco.realtaxdeed.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">RealAuction</mark></a>.<br>Check the <a href=\"https://www.pascoclerk.com/201/Tax-Deed-Sales\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Pasco Clerk &amp; Comptroller Tax Deed Sales page</mark></a> for upcoming auctions.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-pasco-county-tax-sale-overview\">Pasco County Tax Sale Overview</h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Pasco-County-Courthouse-Florida.webp 1081w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Pasco-County-Courthouse-Florida-541x360.webp 541w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Pasco-County-Courthouse-Florida-296x197.webp 296w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Pasco-County-Courthouse-Florida-768x512.webp 768w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Pasco-County-Courthouse-Florida-20x13.webp 20w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Pasco-County-Courthouse-Florida-32x21.webp 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" type=\"image/webp\"><img src=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Pasco-County-Courthouse-Florida.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1081\" srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Pasco-County-Courthouse-Florida.png 1081w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Pasco-County-Courthouse-Florida-541x360.png 541w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Pasco-County-Courthouse-Florida-296x197.png 296w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Pasco-County-Courthouse-Florida-768x512.png 768w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Pasco-County-Courthouse-Florida-20x13.png 20w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Pasco-County-Courthouse-Florida-32x21.png 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" class=\"wp-image-20975 sp-no-webp\" alt=\"Pasco County Courthouse Florida\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"  > </picture></figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline is-style-outline--1\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://success.taxlienschool.com/start-here-tfb?el=tls-vault-county-blog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Book a Call with Dustin Hahn</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-important-things-to-remember\">Important Things to Remember</h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Research Each Property</strong><br>Always check the property’s value, condition, and any liens before bidding.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Understand Title Risks</strong><br>Tax deeds do not guarantee a clear title. You may need to file a quiet title action to get full ownership.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Know About Homesteads</strong><br>If the property had a homestead exemption, the opening bid will include extra costs, like half of the home’s assessed value.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Watch for Surplus Funds</strong><br>If a property sells for more than what’s owed, the previous owner or lienholders can claim the extra money.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-additional-resources\">Additional Resources</h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pascoclerk.com/201/Tax-Deed-Sales\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Pasco Clerk &amp; Comptroller &#8211; Tax Deed Sales</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pascotaxes.com/taxes/tax-information/delinquent-real-estate-taxes/tax-sale-information/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Pasco County Tax Collector &#8211; Tax Certificate Sales</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://pasco.realtaxdeed.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">RealAuction &#8211; Tax Deed Sales Platform</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://www.lienhub.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">LienHub &#8211; Certificate Sales Platform</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/hybrid/hybrid-tax-sales-states/florida-tax-lien-deeds-18-potential-return/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Comprehensive Guide to Florida’s Deed Auction Process and Key Requirements</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/hybrid/hybrid-investing-overview/understanding-hybrid-tax-sale/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Discover the intriguing world of Hybrid Auctions</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://youtu.be/ES5ZPyHRFMM?si=EmzhADUvwB_2FAAr\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Discover Tax Deeds and how you can find property for as little as $50!&nbsp;</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://youtu.be/eNKIUQC6io0?si=b31MOzg-xCeQzAUA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Want to get started with Tax Liens? Watch this video!</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://youtu.be/57fvEHg8e1o?si=NjyDVCGrnXBpyygc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Explore the lucrative world of Florida Tax Liens and Deeds</mark></a></li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-why-pasco-county-tax-sales-are-a-good-opportunity\">Why Pasco County Tax Sales are a Good Opportunity</h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>High Returns</strong><br>You can earn interest rates up to 18% on tax certificates.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Low Competition on Some Properties</strong><br>Especially for rural lots and mobile home sites.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Affordable Entry</strong><br>Property prices are often much lower than in bigger Florida cities like Tampa or Orlando.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Growing Area</strong><br>Pasco County is one of Florida’s fastest-growing counties, with new homes and businesses popping up everywhere.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-need-a-hand\">Need a Hand?</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Explore our <span style=\"color: #0693e3;\"><a style=\"color: #0693e3;\" href=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/general-auction-calendar/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Auction Calendar</a></span> for upcoming sales! Need expert guidance or have questions about the process? <span style=\"color: #0693e3;\"><a href=\"https://success.taxlienschool.com/start-here-tfb?el=tls-vault-county-blog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Book a Call</mark></a></span> Now to connect with a professional who can help you every step of the way. Don’t forget to check out our <span style=\"color: #0693e3;\"><a href=\"https://success.taxlienschool.com/abcs-free-2?el=tls-vault-county-blog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">free resources</mark></a></span> for expert tips, answers, and strategies to make confident investment decisions.</p>\n\n\n\n<p></p>\n<p><em>Sign up or log in to view the full content.</em></p><div id=\"popup-overlay\"></div><div id=\"signup-popup\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 20px;\"><h4>Get Instant Free Access To The Training Vault Now</h4><p>Learn how to get 18-36% returns on your investment and buy property for as little as $500 with tax lien and tax deeds.</p><div class=\"video-container\" style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center; margin: 20px 0;\"><iframe src=\"https://youtube.com/embed/FkB-M8RaSHo\" allowfullscreen style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 560px; height: 315px; border: none; border-radius: 8px;\"></iframe></div><div class=\"button-container\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 10px;\"><button style=\"padding: 10px 20px; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Sign Up for FREE Access</button><button style=\"padding: 10px 20px; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Already a Member? Login</button></div></div>","upcomingCount":0}